 "intro_html": "Radish cubes take a long soak in sweetened salt water, then get tossed in a chili-red seasoning paste. Made your way: <b>coarse salt</b>, garlic, ginger and pear grated on a <b>ceramic grater</b>, and the pear and ginger juice squeezed out through <b>cheesecloth</b>. See also the <a href=\"kimchi.html\">cabbage kimchi</a>.",
