 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir until the salt and sugar dissolve:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"600\">600 ml</span></span></li><li>coarse (kosher) salt <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"50\">50 ml</span></span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"3\">3 tbsp</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Peel the radish and cut it into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 cm</span> cubes</b>.</li><li>Leave the cubes in the brine for <b>around 5 hours</b>, then tip them into a colander.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
