   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~3 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~3 min</span>",
   "title": "Cut the green onions",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"100\">100 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Green onions (or chives)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Grate the garlic, ginger and pear on the ceramic grater (or a fine metal one).</li><li>Squeeze the grated pear and the grated ginger through cheesecloth — the juice is what you want.</li><li>Mix into a thick red paste:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>crushed garlic <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tbsp</span></span></li><li>ginger juice <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span></span></li><li>salted anchovy sauce (or fish sauce) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\">4 tbsp</span></span></li><li>Korean chili powder (gochugaru) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"5\">5 tbsp</span></span></li><li>pear juice <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\">4 tbsp</span></span></li><li>salted shrimp sauce, chopped (or fish sauce) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>kelp (kombu) stock <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\">4 tbsp</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Make the filling",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Grate the garlic, ginger and pear on a ceramic grater.",
      "src": "illustrations/kkakdugi/3-how1.webp?v=bbd258b70e"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Squeeze the grated pear and ginger through cheesecloth — the juice is what you want.",
      "src": "illustrations/kkakdugi/3-how2.webp?v=5ed7fb89a1"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Mix the chili powder, sauces, kelp stock, juices and garlic into a thick red paste.",
